{"3694340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Driving License? Never heard of it", "steam_appid": 3694340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving License? Never heard of it</strong>, is a physics based driving game set in a city where all drivers apparently got their driving licenses out of cereal boxes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 16 different cars, with various types of performance upgrades that can be purchased and installed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with performance upgrades, there are also <i>abilities.</i> These abilities help you deal with the absolute insanity that you will find on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a story that the player uncovers through characters, and different types of driving and racing events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please give us a whishlist if you think thi could be something you enjoy, It helps a great deal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you :)</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving License? Never heard of it</strong>, is a physics based driving game set in a city where all drivers apparently got their driving licenses out of cereal boxes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 16 different cars, with various types of performance upgrades that can be purchased and installed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with performance upgrades, there are also <i>abilities.</i> These abilities help you deal with the absolute insanity that you will find on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a story that the player uncovers through characters, and different types of driving and racing events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >